WEBVTT

00:34.550 --> 00:37.790
Are you still searching for it, Heine?

00:37.790 --> 00:40.600
The entrance to that place.

00:43.300 --> 00:53.500
I’ve been trying to regain the bit of my memory and time that were lost there.

00:59.460 --> 01:00.780
Stop running!

01:05.840 --> 01:08.800
Finally caught you, brat.

01:08.800 --> 01:11.030
Damned kid, causing us trouble.

01:11.800 --> 01:14.640
We’ll tie you up from now on so you won’t be able to use your legs anymore.

01:15.040 --> 01:18.230
A runaway prostitute. A couple of pursuers.

01:18.670 --> 01:20.500
Get up already. What the hell’re ya doing?

01:18.670 --> 01:20.500
Just a normal, everyday occurrence in this world.

01:20.900 --> 01:21.600
Why, you!

01:30.540 --> 01:33.850
Stay still, bitch. Stop struggling.

01:44.100 --> 01:45.250
This girl…

01:46.260 --> 01:48.210
What the hell’re you tryin’ do, ya bastard?!

02:01.860 --> 02:03.410
This is a bit awkward.

02:11.920 --> 02:15.820
A remnant from the glorious pastime of genetic engineering.

02:16.480 --> 02:21.000
An artificial life created and loved by the hands of man, huh.

02:22.220 --> 02:24.620
What am I trying to do, anyway?

02:24.620 --> 02:26.890
I’ve seen it countless times already.

02:27.640 --> 02:31.020
Didn’t I decide not to get involved with that kind of thing anymore?

02:34.400 --> 02:38.920
So, you nonchalantly brought your ass back here just to give me a damn report?

02:40.590 --> 02:45.780
Ya know, nowadays, those mutants are hard to come by.

02:45.780 --> 02:47.960
Are you trying to cause me trouble?

02:48.330 --> 02:51.010
Wait, Miguel, there’s more…

02:52.510 --> 02:54.220
Its location…

02:54.220 --> 02:56.500
Well, I guess you didn’t do too bad, then.

02:57.200 --> 02:59.150
Right-o, I’ll let you off the hook this time.

03:02.340 --> 03:04.590
You bastards, get ready.

03:05.760 --> 03:08.300
Let’s go and get our moody angel.

03:09.140 --> 03:15.680
Whether I asked about her name, family or friends, this girl didn’t utter a single word.

03:16.250 --> 03:20.610
Guess it’s impossible to try to be friendly, at this rate.

03:22.110 --> 03:28.120
You can at least tell me your age, can’t you?
It’s not like I’m going to eat you or something.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.650
Fourteen.

03:32.270 --> 03:35.740
You can’t speak?

03:38.510 --> 03:39.890
I guess not.

03:41.140 --> 03:46.510
When a new artificial life was created,
something was taken from them,

03:46.510 --> 03:52.300
so that they wouldn’t be able to commit suicide to save themselves from their miserable lives.

03:52.910 --> 03:56.810
Damn those scientist scumbags and their way of doing things.

03:58.940 --> 04:02.060
I am, too. I’m the same

04:02.600 --> 04:03.450
as you.

04:08.770 --> 04:09.260
No, stop!

04:15.390 --> 04:17.270
Don’t touch me.

04:20.500 --> 04:25.030
Please, don’t touch…

04:30.590 --> 04:31.170
Li-

04:31.990 --> 04:32.790
Lily!

04:41.800 --> 04:44.400
Shit, why now?

04:52.150 --> 04:52.920
Oh, cra-

04:53.440 --> 04:55.360
Too bad, dude.

05:13.560 --> 05:15.460
See ya.

05:16.260 --> 05:19.540
Good night, Mr. Hero.

05:19.540 --> 05:22.730
If ya happen to see an angel that can’t fly, make sure you tell me.

05:23.090 --> 05:25.460
I’ll do it gently next time.

05:48.890 --> 05:51.240
My whole fuckin’ body hurts.

05:56.660 --> 05:58.040
Fuck off.

06:08.670 --> 06:11.600
Heine, what’ve you been up to?

06:11.600 --> 06:14.620
Think about our teamwork for a bit, will-

06:14.620 --> 06:16.830
Hey, what’s up with those wounds?

06:23.330 --> 06:26.420
Looks like you got beaten up pretty badly.

06:26.730 --> 06:32.660
Hey, hey, just because I can’t see, please don’t turn this place into an armory.

06:35.010 --> 06:36.710
Say, Bishop,

06:37.450 --> 06:39.920
have you ever met God or His angels?

06:40.380 --> 06:44.340
You sure asked a pretty embarrassing question all of a sudden.

06:45.360 --> 06:47.370
For God’s sake, you bastard.

06:47.370 --> 06:49.410
Can’t even take care of your own responsibilities.

06:49.410 --> 06:50.630
Next time, you’d bette-

06:50.630 --> 06:51.780
Ouch, ouch!

06:51.780 --> 06:53.450
Badou, you come too.

06:53.450 --> 06:54.900
Huh? What?!

06:54.900 --> 06:55.960
Ow, ow, ow!

06:56.540 --> 06:58.000
Come again?!

06:59.660 --> 07:01.520
The Almighty, eh?

07:01.940 --> 07:07.500
I’ve been doing this for years, but I’ve yet to meet Him.

07:08.600 --> 07:11.110
Maybe He doesn’t like me.

07:14.570 --> 07:16.180
How’s that?

07:16.180 --> 07:18.380
Do you feel like crying?

07:18.380 --> 07:21.060
What a pity. You can’t, right?

07:21.060 --> 07:23.010
Not with that throat.

07:23.990 --> 07:27.630
Before the guests arrive, I’ll make sure to educate you thoroughly.

07:30.490 --> 07:31.120
Here.

07:33.160 --> 07:36.120
What am I going to do with these-

07:36.120 --> 07:37.850
Hey, my cigarette!

07:38.300 --> 07:41.090
I’ll go from here.

07:41.090 --> 07:43.740
The front’s all yours, Badou.

07:43.740 --> 07:44.940
Huh?

07:44.940 --> 07:47.820
It’s important, right? Teamwork.

07:48.930 --> 07:53.130
Oh, so it’s like that, huh? He wants me to be the bait.

07:53.130 --> 07:55.140
It’s always like this. Always! Always!

07:55.140 --> 07:57.910
He’s
the one with freakin’ inhuman endurance.

07:57.910 --> 08:00.870
Teamwork is important? Bullshit!

08:00.870 --> 08:02.530
Who’s this? A junkie?

08:02.530 --> 08:05.070
Hey, you, better not do anything funny here.

08:07.320 --> 08:09.000
Fine by me, fuckers.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.790
Don’t blame me if you die.

08:11.730 --> 08:14.430
What’s the commotion? Did they arrive?

08:14.430 --> 08:18.320
I’m not too sure. Some crazy guy just appeared out of nowhere. Seems like he’s alone.

08:18.600 --> 08:21.510
He’s alone? What the hell? Hurry up and-

08:23.900 --> 08:25.940
Hey, you! Stop!

08:33.920 --> 08:35.440
Damn that Heine.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.160
I’m gonna kill him someday.

08:39.780 --> 08:42.270
Stop running, stupid brat!

08:42.270 --> 08:44.080
I’ll blow a hole in your body if you don’t stop!

08:49.450 --> 08:51.070
Get down!

08:55.090 --> 08:56.860
Hurry up and take cover.

09:03.640 --> 09:06.400
Damned fucker won’t stop jumping around.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.810
Too bad, dude.

09:21.680 --> 09:22.530
Got him.

09:27.010 --> 09:28.700
Too bad.

09:30.500 --> 09:34.370
The hell? You shouldn’t be standing after all that!

09:34.700 --> 09:36.270
This ain’t funny, bastard!

09:37.940 --> 09:40.680
Don’t come any closer. I said, don’t!

09:42.560 --> 09:43.640
Die.

09:54.760 --> 09:57.030
This ain’t funny.

09:59.870 --> 10:03.060
What the hell are you?

10:05.150 --> 10:07.780
Why won’t you die?

10:09.790 --> 10:13.880
What? Did you eat a bit too much lead?

10:13.880 --> 10:16.800
Yeah, well, something like that.

10:19.720 --> 10:22.130
Those’re some shitty bullets you’re using.

10:27.010 --> 10:28.420
The hell is that?

10:29.150 --> 10:31.610
Something that gives me a bit of extra power.

10:32.550 --> 10:34.970
Aim for the head next time.

10:37.190 --> 10:39.090
Damned monster.

10:39.630 --> 10:42.710
Yeah, I think so, too.

10:44.000 --> 10:48.370
It’s cold…

10:53.940 --> 10:56.800
You must be scared of me now.

11:04.920 --> 11:11.020
By the way, when can I stop doing this? Can I freakin’ go home now?!

11:11.020 --> 11:13.060
Don’t ask us that!

11:19.180 --> 11:21.790
Wow, wonderful!

11:21.790 --> 11:23.340
Oh, Jesus!

11:23.340 --> 11:25.080
Don’t you love me?

11:25.080 --> 11:29.340
Why the heck did you have her wear that when you can’t even see?

11:29.340 --> 11:31.220
What are you saying?

11:31.220 --> 11:37.090
It looks perfect on her irresistible-to-hug and slender body.

11:31.440 --> 11:35.580
Sick

11:34.020 --> 11:37.400
Sick

11:37.090 --> 11:38.580
Are you really blind?

11:37.400 --> 11:38.580
Sick

11:40.510 --> 11:43.530
Me? You’re scared of me?

11:43.530 --> 11:46.210
Of course, you crazy, jailbait-loving priest.

11:46.840 --> 11:49.960
Oh? Is your gynophobia not affecting you?

11:50.410 --> 11:52.470
Huh? Oh.

11:54.370 --> 11:58.880
Seems that I’m all right with her.

12:04.690 --> 12:05.610
What?

12:07.630 --> 12:08.450
N.

12:09.480 --> 12:10.320
I.

12:11.470 --> 12:12.320
L.

12:13.400 --> 12:14.120
L.

12:15.090 --> 12:16.020
Nill.

12:16.700 --> 12:18.910
Is that your name? Nill?

12:45.410 --> 12:49.540
Looks like you’ve been quite lively lately, Heine.

12:50.460 --> 12:55.500
Seems you’re enjoying yourself, living a comfortable, normal, human life.

12:56.160 --> 12:59.070
Did you remember after you saw that girl?

12:59.890 --> 13:00.880
About Lily?

13:02.940 --> 13:04.580
Wanna come over to our side?

13:05.240 --> 13:06.130
Bang.

13:08.660 --> 13:10.940
It’s important that you’re doing well.

13:10.940 --> 13:13.140
Are you comfortable with this style of living?

13:13.660 --> 13:16.550
I’m very worried about you, you know.

13:16.550 --> 13:19.670
Not only me, but everyone down there, as well.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.770
My body…

13:21.240 --> 13:24.060
Your body is very delicate.

13:24.690 --> 13:27.310
Has your neck been hurting lately?

13:27.900 --> 13:30.640
Or does it throb, even at this moment;

13:30.640 --> 13:33.830
the essence of Kerberos that’s inside you?

13:34.090 --> 13:36.180
Shut the hell up, scumbag.

13:39.280 --> 13:41.110
You’re the same as always.

13:41.670 --> 13:44.020
I’ll come and visit you again sometime.

13:45.420 --> 13:50.090
Have a good day, Heine Rammsteiner.

14:14.250 --> 14:18.340
Stop pretending to be intimate with me like an idiot.

14:18.340 --> 14:20.240
Fine by me, scumbags.

14:20.750 --> 14:24.830
I’ll take all of you <i>and</i>
the bunch of fuckers down there to Hell.

14:25.030 --> 14:27.290
Presented by

14:25.330 --> 14:27.290
Fuck up, gentlemen.
